  "title": "StoryCanvas: a small harness for composable video-generation methods",
  "subtitle": "Community work plugs in through typed capabilities; the kernel keeps planning, media, and provenance inspectable.",
  "description": "StoryCanvas architecture and Plugin API. Community methods become Skills or executable Plugins, are distributed in Packs, selected by Profiles, resolved by a capability registry, executed by the minimal kernel, and projected into host-neutral inspectable Runs.",
